{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>ואם בית אישה נדרה.</b> The widow in former times — והניא אותה לא תקיים נדרה — [does not apply] in her days of widowhood; this speaks of the future, that she vows and the husband dies before the appointed time arrives. The word סליחה is explicit."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {0 "The phrase והניא אותה לא תקיים נדרה is quoted from v. 9; Ibn Ezra's syntax is compressed and the logical connection to the case of the widow is implicit."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:51.876354537Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}